    <li class="qandaentry">
    <div class="question">
    <p class="para">Why do most aromatic hydrocarbons have only limited solubility in water? Would you expect their solubility to be higher, lower, or the same in ethanol compared with water? Why?</p>
    </div>
    </li>
    <li class="qandaentry">
    <div class="question">
    <p class="para">Predict whether each compound will dissolve in water and explain why.</p>

    <ol start="1" style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
