</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_Brown_et_al./04.E:_Aqueous_Reactions_(Exercises)" class="mt-section" id="section_7"><span id="Numerical_Problems"></span><h3 class="editable">Numerical Problems</h3>

<ol class="qandadiv">
    <li class="qandaentry">
    <div class="question">
    <p class="para">What mass of precipitate would you expect to obtain by mixing 250 mL of a solution containing 4.88 g of Na<sub>2</sub>CrO<sub>4</sub> with 200 mL of a solution containing 3.84 g of AgNO<sub>3</sub>? What is the final nitrate ion concentration?</p>
    </div>
    </li>
