<hr />
</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_Brown_et_al./04.E:_Aqueous_Reactions_(Exercises)" class="mt-section" id="section_20"><span id="Conceptual_Problems_5"></span><h3 class="editable">Conceptual Problems</h3>

<ol class="qandadiv">
    <li class="qandaentry">
    <div class="question">
    <p class="para">Which of the representations best corresponds to a 1 M aqueous solution of each compound? Justify your answers.</p>

